  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "rel_c",
      "defType": "meta/comment",
      "position": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": -294
      },
      "params": {
        "text": "Relaxed cells\n\nThe same 160 random points twice. On the left as they fall: clumps and gaps. On the right Scatter's `relax` (Lloyd relaxation, 30 passes) spreads them evenly, keeping the exact count; Cells shows each point's Voronoi cell.\n\nTry `relax` at 1, 3, 10. Scatter's `relax` mode evens out any points you wire in.",
        "width": 460,
        "height": 230
      },
      "portValues": {
        "text": "Relaxed cells\n\nThe same 160 random points twice. On the left as they fall: clumps and gaps. On the right Scatter's `relax` (Lloyd relaxation, 30 passes) spreads them evenly, keeping the exact count; Cells shows each point's Voronoi cell.\n\nTry `relax` at 1, 3, 10. Scatter's `relax` mode evens out any points you wire in.",
        "width": 460,
        "height": 230
      }
    },
